BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 166.75 Tm (decision.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 151.52 Tm (Use a durable event table rather than a chain of fragile scripts. Each record should contain event_id, asset_id,) Tj ET
